            <div xml:id="m-919f5f23-4f9d-4679-b46f-d85d33ed6620">
              <lg xml:id="m-c3997e6f-13a3-4478-9825-468f4c858822">
                <l xml:id="m-dcd7330e-869e-413f-bf22-7441b0081db1" facs="#m-fdb4eec4-79ee-4ca3-8c96-b639c7678a05" label="ambiguous">166</l><l xml:id="m-eec17dca-5be8-4463-be09-3a55c971baf0" facs="#m-d25e59e4-3ef8-493c-abe3-2c868acf2a42" label="ambiguous">Laudate Dominum. 1. D, Da, f, g. a-. — 2. D.</l><l xml:id="m-57aa1bb2-fae6-4ed3-a3cd-c8199d04645a" facs="#m-306a8147-a249-4b56-bb5e-2bfda18f5a25" label="lyrics-like">6. O Dómine quia égo sérvus túus: * égo sérvus túus, et fllius</l><l xml:id="m-7a29276f-d7eb-45b9-887a-672d1697cdf0" facs="#m-adc80b92-5a41-4220-a483-525ab6ab424a" label="lyrics-like">ancilloe túae.</l><l xml:id="m-11ed366b-19ed-4e32-8c44-9f407a1cc9e2" facs="#m-38d130e3-88d0-435c-a551-3fb343eead63" label="lyrics-like">7. Dirupísti víncula méa: t tibi sacrificábo hóstiam láudis, *e</l><l xml:id="m-88047b1d-ec63-45ef-a18b-8fe1d8e8d17c" facs="#m-b910599b-c22f-4666-907a-679483d2cfa2" label="lyrics-like">nómen Dómini invocábo.</l><l xml:id="m-4af07c6c-035b-476a-84d5-ae2ba8427dc2" facs="#m-70c101bf-1122-40e3-9f05-cb8378c5bb24" label="lyrics-like">8. Vota méa Dómino réddam in conspéctu ómnis pópuli éjus:*in</l><l xml:id="m-f371fbdd-42da-433e-b4a3-74cf1e4f3efe" facs="#m-c0afcc53-b866-4f64-adbf-e432a4fb503a" label="lyrics-like">átriis dómus Dómini, in médio tút /erúsalem.</l><l xml:id="m-dec5dff4-3658-4571-91e1-bf7f7fa09af3" facs="#m-b876df87-3f9e-48ad-be22-b961d0282486" label="lyrics-like">9. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-3ad5006e-30eb-4d89-81ad-f8ddf4c00784" facs="#m-17efac11-f8f6-4a06-af9f-d7f346cb96df" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2ef0fc8-fb08-4415-a252-27e483f094d0" facs="#m-c859497e-0704-4743-b596-4431543e731a" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-ac844f75-17e3-4765-824c-2c5c89d9ab2c" facs="#m-08121c34-e67b-40f2-80d2-81cdb290f4f6" label="ambiguous">Psalm 116. Laudate Dominum.</l><l xml:id="m-64ddbeb6-3d42-4c34-8148-dc64877971ed" facs="#m-d3fbed99-7818-4a4e-9f5f-9e7945458400" label="ambiguous">Tone 1. D, Dr, f. g, a-.</l><l xml:id="m-ef031b6c-0f8c-479e-bf03-f6be848183ba" facs="#m-64364e8f-bb0d-401d-a374-987eda15075c" label="text-like">Endings of r accent with z prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-734e6ea5-b899-4349-b0cd-8640177cac93" facs="#m-b25b2f34-e8fa-471e-992e-09ae37773f0d" label="text-like">Mediant of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-b2b4f41e-0958-4701-8e07-162f0ca25f33" facs="#m-7e2cde4a-7873-4e7b-a214-1cccdfa7f156" label="text-like">tory syllables. (For the ending Da, an</l><l xml:id="m-108318e2-f886-4ca0-8a93-fe900fd6595a" facs="#m-20a57e60-e3c8-4a76-b420-dbac313aeb1f" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation ot</l><l xml:id="m-fd14b3d1-d878-47d7-8201-a7bbc29514fd" facs="#m-58c7791a-437f-4af0-baf8-1e25861be27c" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadencei)</l><l xml:id="m-506cd6d1-b79b-4da9-8c82-9f716a0d67c0" facs="#m-0a360de0-8edf-461b-b895-9fccf9601188" label="lyrics-like">1. Laudá-te Dóminum ómnes gén-tes : * laudá-te é-um ômnes pópu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5f68f2ba-e9c8-40bb-952f-04ba7d7e4b0e" facs="#m-11335f98-3bac-4cab-a21b-efd0243f933b" label="ambiguous">r</l><l xml:id="m-73c92102-c210-43aa-88da-07214858afbd" facs="#m-936c9e50-c9b8-40fd-9c04-130310710b9b" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-4335c29e-f6ac-42e3-9c80-09b686a8a5fa" facs="#m-f64491f6-db93-466d-a16c-797dc529457f" label="ambiguous">— D¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5ec4a1f-ceb8-4b42-bfca-eae9d4107569" facs="#m-b2bbb317-8b14-41c1-a33f-d47c1a599d61" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-13ac3b0d-96c9-44d1-9154-b244a3a31440" facs="#m-90613900-ca7e-46ea-a1e4-9a0cd0d77615" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-0c54ca53-5939-4f8f-baed-b7f1ff166d40" facs="#m-24d41dcf-f1c8-4373-9338-b6b07623a8c4" label="lyrics-like">li. or: pópu-li. opópu-li. or: pópuli. or: pópu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-97a7f01a-52f1-4db7-b2b2-f8c9c06b6b72" facs="#m-0cfba475-a4fc-4ad8-80c3-137a203dd85e" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confirmáta est super nos miserieórdia éjus :* et véritas</l><l xml:id="m-8c8a1ae1-8b7f-43c2-b640-290060e5ec54" facs="#m-d077bfc1-1401-4833-bd32-737aabeff894" label="lyrics-like">Dómini mánet in œetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-80ea5d3b-757a-44bd-a283-a544a0e096d5" facs="#m-562541d1-a127-46f8-92df-3a01a97cd1c0" label="lyrics-like">3. Glória Pâtri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-8d48b39f-e4cd-4fda-8fe3-137ceb4c4b0a" facs="#m-b460774b-c97a-45bf-b38f-cfbb177e8d0e" label="lyrics-like">4. Sicut érat in princípio, et núne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-520ab3f0-5c0f-475e-b232-0f1a420765a4" facs="#m-4a770d31-d764-4746-833d-7a13648b52d3" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-37a49ea1-9b02-43b0-a616-04f2cee34da0" facs="#m-cea777f6-f821-4d72-902a-5b6d381b7f61" label="ambiguous">Tone 2. D.</l><l xml:id="m-66c79678-585b-47fb-a586-69c210e19a14" facs="#m-234cd36c-04fd-46cb-af3f-53c816caf575" label="text-like">Ending of 1 accent with I prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-920f0dc2-ad7c-4430-95d2-9e27232f5f99" facs="#m-abcedbb6-bcba-479b-afbe-c09d9cce6914" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent.</l><l xml:id="m-b30575b5-f2a5-4427-9459-ea6e1b086a80" facs="#m-a126966a-1370-4d34-bbb6-886f370d996e" label="ambiguous">tory syllable.</l><l xml:id="m-8fd3f97a-e247-4cb3-87ad-1d0f53d7f2fa" facs="#m-aaee4fcd-5bea-47c2-ac40-e765b2e4b8cb" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-701aa894-76fc-47b1-9b5c-aee567e52329" facs="#m-01fa54dc-255d-44c8-8279-cce4ae46bcb3" label="lyrics-like">1. Laudá-te Dóminum ômnes gén-tes:* laudá-te é-um ómnes pópu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-44606be0-0f2f-4e87-964d-ba38e9b9425b" facs="#m-78f555df-19c5-47ef-9cdb-15edc3ea5bda" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confirmáta est super nos misericórdia éjus: *et véritas</l><l xml:id="m-c72e48a6-d6b2-44a4-9577-8f7de991ec3a" facs="#m-f247f5ae-b2bb-49ec-a859-302d608e3d89" label="lyrics-like">Dómini mánet in aetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-d0918113-40eb-43d4-aa85-a5e8250c25d6" facs="#m-ab51bb61-ce7a-4928-a5ba-5658e602f4fc" label="lyrics-like">3. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritut Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-6fb364c5-9c74-41f3-8d00-c486f7a249e2" facs="#m-c0b71550-599c-43dc-ab4d-d9e22cc72f69" label="lyrics-like">4. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-c6f99bcd-626b-46d9-bb4e-ec37dcd1a41a" facs="#m-77e44cf3-8d1d-478d-9536-814eab4ce535" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
